 PARITY MAP (web source is the spec)
================================================================================
  DATA (P1/S8 state-holder seam — no HTTP in the view):
    useCostBreakdown → GET /analytics/tco?vehicle_id=  (TCOAnalytics)
    useVehicles / useUnits / useFormatting / useTranslation / useThemeChartPalette
    → modeled by CostBreakdownSource pushing CostBreakdownUpdate(status, connection,
      isFetching, cost: CostBreakdownDTO, units: CostUnitPrefs, updatedAt).

  DERIVATIONS ported VERBATIM (pinned by the executed harness):
    costPerDist  : cpk==0 ? 0 : unit=='mi' ? cpk*1.60934 : cpk   (miles-only quirk kept)
    currentMonth : last monthly_breakdown.ev_cost → fmtNumber(_,0) for the hero
    donut        : monthly_breakdown.slice(-6) → SectorMark per month, palette[i]
    ranked       : every month → formatCurrency(ev_cost); list sorts desc, top 5
    stat cards   : Total Cost = formatCurrency(total_charging_cost);
                   Cost / {unit} = costPerDist>0 ? formatCurrency(costPerDist,3) : '—';
                   Gas Savings  = total_savings>0 ? formatCurrency(total_savings) : '—'
                                  (+ "Lifetime" sublabel)
    saving badge : total_savings>0 ;  savedVsGas subtitle : monthly_savings>0

  STATES (every one renders — no hidden surfaces):
    loading  → skeleton chrome (compact hero skeleton / donut+rows+stat skeleton)
    empty    → ContentUnavailableView "No cost data" + hint (never a blank box)
    error    → QueryError-equivalent: icon + title + message + Retry affordance
    stale    → amber freshness chip + stale banner + autoRefreshIfStale()
    offline  → muted chip + offline banner over the last-known cached breakdown
    content  → compact big-number  OR  standard donut + ranked list + 3 stat cards

  i18n (P1/S10) — every source string resolved through the facade, 0 hard literals:
    Cost Breakdown / This Month / Saved {{amount}} vs gas / Saving / No cost data /
    Total Cost / Cost / {{unit}} / Gas Savings / Lifetime  (+ registry name+desc,
    + native chrome live/updating/stale/offline/refresh/retry/open + state copy + a11y)

  TELEMETRY (P1/S11): CostBreakdownModel.start() → telemetry.viewOpened(surface:
